WEBVTT

00:18:59.479 --> 00:19:01.761
for protecting and improving.

00:19:01.761 --> 00:19:03.404
We also need them to understand

00:19:03.404 --> 00:19:06.433
something that doesn't seem adequately appreciated

00:19:06.433 --> 00:19:08.896
in our increasingly tech-dependent world,

00:19:08.896 --> 00:19:10.579
that art and design

00:19:10.579 --> 00:19:12.492
are not luxuries,

00:19:12.492 --> 00:19:14.318
nor somehow incompatible

00:19:14.318 --> 00:19:16.187
with science and engineering.

00:19:16.187 --> 00:19:21.762
They are in fact essential to what makes us special.

00:19:21.762 --> 00:19:24.277
Someday, if you get the chance,

00:19:24.277 --> 00:19:25.814
perhaps you can take your kids

00:19:25.814 --> 00:19:27.585
to the actual Pantheon,

00:19:27.585 --> 00:19:30.245
as we will our daughter Kira,